      {
        "variation": "default",
        "version": "initial",
        "items": [
          {
            "point": "One valve and one processor per pipe"
          },
          {
            "point": "Pressure measured and corrected at the pipe foot"
          },
          {
            "point": "No wind regulators: a blower and a distribution box are enough"
          }
        ],
        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "The technology",
          "title": "Wind control per pipe, not per wind chest",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "In a classic organ, all pipes on a wind chest share the same wind. In L'Explorateur every pipe has its own smARTvalve, a few millimetres from the pipe foot. The valve measures the pressure drop on its input side and opens further to compensate, so every pipe keeps its wind when many pipes sound at once.",
              "spans": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The first valves were small loudspeakers converted into valves. smARTvalve, the second generation, was designed by Tony Decap and produced industrially. For the organist it means control over each note: “you can define the nature of the attack of the sound.”",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "start": 203,
                  "end": 258,
                  "type": "em"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "image": {
            "dimensions": {
              "width": 1672,
              "height": 941
            },
            "alt": "smARTvalves with their electronics",
            "copyright": null,
            "url": "https://images.prismic.io/decap/IWKJJma9LmOjjrPe_decap-smartvalve-samples.jpg?auto=format,compress",
            "id": "IWKJJma9LmOjjrPe",
            "edit": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "zoom": 1,
              "background": "transparent"
            }
          },
          "video": {
            "link_type": "Media"
          },
          "image_brief": "Close-up of the smARTvalves under the pipes inside L'Explorateur, dark background, 4:3",
          "media_side": "Image right",
          "aspect": "Landscape 4:3",
          "cta_label": "How smARTvalve works",
          "cta_link": {
