      },
      {
        "variation": "default",
        "version": "initial",
        "items": [
          {
            "point": "Fits in a 20 m³ van"
          },
          {
            "point": "Maximum 1,200 kg"
          },
          {
            "point": "Modules rebuilt to identical standard dimensions"
          }
        ],
        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "Built to travel",
          "title": "One van, twelve modules, under two hours",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "From the start, L'Explorateur had two limits: it had to fit in a 20 m³ van and weigh no more than 1,200 kg. Every technical choice followed from that.",
              "spans": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The organ is divided into modules that are carried in, placed and connected. Because smARTvalve makes wind regulators unnecessary, the wind system is only a blower and a distribution box. “For L'Explorateur it means an easy setup of less than 2 hours from the truck arriving to playing.”",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "start": 188,
                  "end": 287,
                  "type": "em"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "image": {
            "dimensions": {
              "width": 815,
              "height": 542
            },
            "alt": "Render of L'Explorateur's transportable modules",
            "copyright": null,
            "url": "https://images.prismic.io/decap/aZCn_lWLo0XkEg-j_20221008_mohaibalazs_074-1-2-1.png?auto=format,compress",
            "id": "aZCn_lWLo0XkEg-j",
            "edit": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "zoom": 1,
              "background": "transparent"
            }
          },
          "video": {
            "link_type": "Media"
          },
          "image_brief": "L'Explorateur modules being unloaded from the van or set up in a hall, 4:3",
