                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list-item",
              "text": "Console software: a tool to programme attack, development and vibrato per sound, inspired by ADSR envelopes.",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "start": 0,
                  "end": 17,
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list-item",
              "text": "Polyphone pipes for the bass of the Principal and Salicional: several notes from one pipe.",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "start": 0,
                  "end": 15,
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list-item",
              "text": "New swell boxes designed by Tony Decap, for the softest dynamics.",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "start": 0,
                  "end": 15,
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list-item",
              "text": "A lighter 16′ Ophicléide, and a free-reed rank from an 1830 Muller orgue expressif.",
